      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JETSON (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (25.89) last time in a Grade 4/5 at Murray Bridge. Form here at this distance is sound. Should be very hard to beat this time. MINNIE'S MY MUM (6) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing second (16.60) at Murray Bridge in a Special conditions race over 300m. The form out of last race has been strong. Expected to be in this for a long way. COMPTON CHINOOK (4) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4 lengths (23.34) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Expected to give a good account. CLOSE SHAVE (8) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
